{{!
    @template local_awareness/editor/slide_head

    The heading row of one carousel slide in the notice editor: the slide's place in the strip, and
    the three actions that rearrange it - move up, move down, remove. Each is a submit the form
    treats as a no-submit button, the mechanism core's own repeat deletion uses: a press re-renders
    the form with the rows rearranged and saves nothing, and the client hints on the button are the
    ones core puts on its delete button, so a press is not stopped by client-side validation.
    Rendered into a static element by notice_form, which registers the names; the number is the
    slide's place on screen, not its row index. A disabled action is one the strip has no room for.

    Context variables required for this template:
      * heading - the slide's heading, already a translated string carrying its place
      * actions - the three buttons, each with name, label, arialabel, disabled, focus, destructive

    Example context (json):
    {
        "heading": "Slide 2",
        "actions": [
            {"name": "slide_moveup[1]", "label": "Move up", "arialabel": "Move up: slide 2",
             "disabled": false, "focus": true, "destructive": false},
            {"name": "slide_movedown[1]", "label": "Move down", "arialabel": "Move down: slide 2",
             "disabled": true, "focus": false, "destructive": false},
            {"name": "slide_delete[1]", "label": "Remove slide", "arialabel": "Remove slide 2",
             "disabled": false, "focus": false, "destructive": true}
        ]
    }
}}
<span class="la-slide-head">
    <span class="la-slide-head-number">{{heading}}</span>
    <span class="la-slide-head-actions">
        {{#actions}}
        <input type="submit" name="{{name}}" value="{{label}}" aria-label="{{arialabel}}"
            class="la-slide-action{{#destructive}} la-slide-action--remove{{/destructive}}"
            data-no-submit="1" data-skip-validation="1" onclick="skipClientValidation = true;"
            {{#disabled}}disabled="disabled"{{/disabled}} {{#focus}}autofocus="autofocus"{{/focus}}>
        {{/actions}}
    </span>
</span>
